WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=sw.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.960
Video hii inaeleza jinsi ya kuandaa mtoto na mama, au matunzo, kabla ya kutekeleza ufadhili

2
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.840
vipimo vya reflex kwa watoto wachanga na watoto wakubwa.

3
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.720
Mtoto anapaswa kushikiliwa kwa usalama, lakini kwa raha,

4
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:20.524
ama kwenye mapaja juu ya bega, au ikiwa mtoto amelala chali.

5
00:00:20.524 --> 00:00:23.840
Ni muhimu kwao kujisikia salama.

6
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:28.640
Watoto wachanga wanaweza kukosa utulivu na wanaweza kuhitaji kuzungushwa.

7
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:35.600
Kuchunguza muda mfupi baada ya kulisha kunaweza kusaidia kwani watakuwa wametulia na kusinzia kidogo.

8
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.800
Watoto wetu wote wanaweza kutulia kwa kucheza na toy kwa muda mfupi.

9
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:46.560
Ongea kwa sauti ya urafiki na ujaribu kufikia usawa wa macho yao.

10
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:52.080
Eleza utafanya nini na upate wazo kabla ya kuanza.

11
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:57.493
Kwanza, muulize mama au mlezi kama hawana kosa lolote kwao

12
00:00:57.493 --> 00:00:59.040
jicho au maono ya mtoto

13
00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.880
na muda gani hawana tatizo.

14
00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.720
Ifuatayo, angalia uso na macho ya mtoto.

15
00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.336
Jiulize baadhi ya maswali.

16
00:01:06.336 --> 00:01:11.184
Mtoto anaonekana kuwa na maumivu katika jicho moja au yote mawili?

17
00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:12.800
Je, macho yamefunguliwa

18
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.488
au wanazifunga kwa nguvu?

19
00:01:15.488 --> 00:01:18.560
Je, kuna kumwagilia au kutokwa kutoka kwa macho?

20
00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:21.440
Je, macho yana ukubwa sawa?

21
00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.000
Je, kope zimevimba?

22
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.040
Sasa, fikiria jinsi mtoto anavyoona.

23
00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:31.040
Sogeza uso wako polepole kutoka upande hadi upande, ukiangalia macho.

24
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.880
Fanya tabasamu la kimya.

25
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:37.040
Mtoto hufuata harakati za uso wako?

26
00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.840
Au kujibu tabasamu lako la kimya?

27
00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.040
Tena jiulize maswali.

28
00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.440
Je, macho yote mawili yanatembea kwa uhuru na kwa pamoja?

29
00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:51.040
Je, macho yamenyooka, au jicho moja linaelekea ndani au nje?

30
00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:54.670
Je, macho hutetemeka?

31
00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:59.866
Unaweza pia kutumia tochi kwenye arclights na picha za

32
00:01:59.866 --> 00:02:01.350
kitanda ili kupata umakini

33
00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.590
na kutathmini ubora wa maono.

34
00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:08.230
Sogeza upande unaolengwa kuelekea juu na chini.

35
00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:13.470
Angalia ikiwa mtoto anarekebisha na kufuata malengo.

36
00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:17.790
Wanapofikia na kuelekeza kwa usahihi

37
00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:22.110
lengo, mara nyingi jicho moja tu haliwezi kuona vizuri.

38
00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:26.830
Wewe au mama unaweza kufunika jicho moja, kisha lingine.

39
00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:32.784
Sogeza lengo na ulinganishe jinsi mtoto anavyofanya wakati wa kutumia macho yote mawili,

40
00:02:32.784 --> 00:02:34.910
kisha mmoja baada ya mwingine.

41
00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:40.323
Ikiwa mtoto hapendi jicho moja lifunikwe, basi linapendekeza lisifunikwe

42
00:02:40.323 --> 00:02:41.870
jicho halioni

43
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:42.870
vizuri sana.

44
00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:48.602
Ikiwa unafikiri unaweza kuona kitu kibaya kwa jicho la nje, angalia zaidi

45
00:02:48.602 --> 00:02:49.830
kwa karibu kutumia

46
00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:52.870
mwisho wa kitanzi cha mwangaza.

47
00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:58.310
Washa taa na usogeze hadi karibu 6 cm.

48
00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:04.390
Huenda ukahitaji kutumia kidole chako kufungua kope kwa upole.

49
00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:07.390
Jiulize baadhi ya maswali.

50
00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:12.470
Je, sehemu nyeupe ya jicho tayari ni ya pinki?

51
00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:19.670
Mmboni huyu au konea kijivu au nyeupe ni duru ya mmboni.

52
00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:23.190
Je, unaweza kuona miili yoyote ya kigeni?

53
00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:26.550
Sasa uko tayari kufanya mtihani wa reflex.
